# plugin/ and .claude-plugin/ are ALSO generated (by `aigile bundle`) but are the
# published Claude Code plugin — they must stay tracked for
# `/plugin marketplace add Gmark2000/AIgile-Method` to work.

# NOTE: .aigile-core/, .github/agents/, .github/prompts/ and .aigile-manifest.json are
# also installer output but are still tracked from earlier commits. Ignoring them here
# would have no effect until they are untracked (`git rm -r --cached <path>`).
